  "goodToKnow": "Montieren means to assemble, install or mount: Reifen montieren, eine Lampe montieren. Die Montage is assembly or installation (also film montage), and der Monteur is a fitter or installer. Auf Montage sein means working away from home on installation jobs, common for German engineers abroad. Die Montageanleitung is the assembly instructions, famously from Swedish flat-pack furniture. Demontieren means to dismantle."
